  "name": "Cucumber Bites with Dill Cream and Smoked Salmon",
  "subtitle": "Cool cucumber rounds with lemony dill cream",
  "description": "A no-cook snack of crisp cucumber, herbed cream cheese, and smoked salmon, finished with fresh dill.",
